Package: spdrs60
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libqt3-mt 
Recommends: libqt3-i18n, qt3-qtconfig
Description: SpDrS60, Controlcenter for digital model railroads
 Graphical program to comfortably control a digital model railroad.
 Visual appearance and usage comply to the SpDr of the german national
 railroad company. SpDrS60 needs a SRCP server (e.g. erddcd) as a link
 to the physical layout of the model. 
